s","unit_id":"u2","target_id":54,"content":{"question":"虛擬化的優點包含？","options":["執行多個 OS","硬體直接存取","資源整合","應用程式開發測試"],"correct_answer":"執行多個 OS\n資源整合\n應用程式開發測試","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u2","target_id":55,"content":{"question":"In virtualization technology, the software that provides virtualization services is called [__1__] (Please answer using lowercase English abbreviations).","options":[],"correct_answer":"vmm","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u2","target_id":56,"content":{"question":"雲端運算中，IaaS 代表什麼？","options":["Internet as a Service","Input as a Service","Interface as a Service","Infrastructure as a Service"],"correct_answer":"Infrastructure as a Service","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u2","target_id":57,"content":{"question":"[__1__] 是一種雲端運算模型，它提供使用者按需存取伺服器、儲存、網路和虛擬化等基礎設施資源（請用小寫英文縮寫回答）。","options":[],"correct_answer":"iaas","type":"fill_blank"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u2","target_id":58,"content":{"question":"即時作業系統 (Real-time OS) 的核心特徵是？","options":["約定的時間限制","圖形化介面","多使用者","高效能"],"correct_answer":"約定的時間限制","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u2","target_id":59,"content":{"question":"開放原始碼作業系統通常使用什麼授權？","options":["Proprietary","Closed-source","DRM","GPL"],"correct_answer":"GPL","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u3","target_id":90,"content":{"question":"In operating system design, what two principles are separated to achieve maximum flexibility?","options":["Protection and security","Policy and mechanism","Kernel and user","Mechanism and architecture"],"correct_answer":"Policy and mechanism","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u3","target_id":112,"content":{"question":"The macOS kernel combines Mach microkernel and BSD Unix parts. This architecture is called:","options":["Monolithic system","Hybrid system","Simple system","Pure microkernel system"],"correct_answer":"Hybrid system","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u3","target_id":125,"content"