ad and execute program\nprogramming language support","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u3","target_id":233,"content":{"question":"Which of the following is a communication mechanism that uses message passing?","options":["Memory-mapped I/O","Signal Bus","Shared Library","Message Passing"],"correct_answer":"Message Passing","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u3","target_id":237,"content":{"question":"下列哪些系統呼叫屬於 Unix/Linux 系統中的「檔案管理（File Management）」範疇？","options":["write()","read()","open()","ioctl()"],"correct_answer":"write()\nread()\nopen()","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u3","target_id":245,"content":{"question":"Apple''s iOS architecture is structured into which of the following layers?","options":["Cocoa Touch","Media Services","Core Services & Core OS"],"correct_answer":"Cocoa Touch\nMedia Services\nCore Services & Core OS","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u3","target_id":256,"content":{"question":"能夠在生產系統上進行即時動態追蹤與動態檢測（Live Instrumentation）的進階工具為何？","options":["top","DTrace","Task Manager","GRUB"],"correct_answer":"DTrace","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u3","target_id":276,"content":{"question":"What is the name of the virtual machine that runs translated Java bytecode in Android?","options":["Mach","JVM","Dalvik virtual machine","Aqua"],"correct_answer":"Dalvik virtual machine","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u3","target_id":292,"content":{"question":"Which operating system architecture moves most functionality out of the kernel?","options":["Monolithic","Hybrid","DOS","Microkernel"],"correct_answer":"Microkernel","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u3","target_id":319,"content":{"question":"Which statements accurately describe the multitasking program execution in FreeBSD/Unix?","options":["User login invokes user''s choice of shell","Shell executes fork() to create process","Executes exec() to load program into process","Process can only return error code 100","Process exits must always return error code 100"],"correct_answer":"User login invokes user''s choice of shell\nShell executes fork() to create process\nExecutes exec() to load program into process","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u3","target_id":320,"content":{"question":"Which of the following are modules supported in modern modular kernels like Solaris?","options":["Scheduling classes","Physical hardware wires","File systems","Loadable system calls"],"correct_answer":"Scheduling classes\nFile systems\nLoadable system calls","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u3","target_id":321,"content":{"question":"Which core design method dynamically loads core components at runtime with object-oriented features?","options":["Simple structure","Layered approach","Loadable kernel modules","Monolithic kernel"],"correct_answer":"Loadable kernel modules","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u4","target_id":11,"content":{"question":"下列哪些是 Cooperating Process 的優點？","options":["efficiency","information sharing","modularity","computation speedup"],"correct_answer":"information sharing\nmodularity\ncomputation speedup","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u4","target_id":17,"content":{"question":"Which of the following are reasons for process cooperation?","options":["convenience","modularity","information sharing","computation speedup"],"correct_answer":"convenience\nmodularity\ninformation sharing\ncomputation speedup","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u4","target_id":30,"content":{"question":"What is a characteristic of an I/O-bound process?","options":["rarely performs I/O operations","spends most of its time performing I/O operations","has only one CPU burst","spends most of its time computing"],"correct_answer":"spends most of its time performing I/O operations","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u4","target_id":34,"content":{"question":"以下哪些是遠端程序呼叫（RPC）的特點？","options":["抽象化了網路系統中的程序呼叫","使用樁（stubs）來定位伺服器並封送參數","使用外部資料表示法（XDR）格式處理資料","需要親屬關係"],"correct_answer":"抽象化了網路系統中的程序呼叫\n使用樁（stubs）來定位伺服器並封送參數\n使用外部資料表示法（XDR）格式處理資料","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u4","target_id":64,"content":{"question":"Which part of a process''s memory contains memory used for dynamic memory allocation?","options":["stack","text section","heap","data section"],"correct_answer":"heap","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u4","target_id":89,"content":{"question":"What is a characteristic of an CPU-bound process?","options":["spends most of its time computing","has only one CPU burst","spends most of its time performing I/O operations","rarely performs I/O operations"],"correct_answer":"spends most of its time computing","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u4","target_id":90,"content":{"question":"Which of the following are the advantages of process cooperation?","options":["modularity","information sharing","efficiency","computation speedup"],"correct_answer":"modularity\ninformation sharing\ncomputation speedup","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u4","target_id":104,"content":{"question":"上下文切換（context switch）的時間屬於什麼？","options":["系統的開銷","系統的正常操作","程序的有效時間","系統的有益工作"],"correct_answer":"系統的開銷","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u4","target_id":120,"content":{"question":"Which of the following are different types of processes in the Chrome browser''s multi-process architecture?","options":["browser process","kernel process","plug-in process","renderer process"],"correct_answer":"browser process\nplug-in process\nrenderer process","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u4","target_id":126,"content":{"question":"What term refers to having more than one executing branch in a single process?","options":["multiprogramming","thread","context switch","multitasking"],"correct_answer":"thread","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u4","target_id":133,"content":{"question":"In a process control block (PCB), which piece of information records the location of the next instruction to be executed?","options":["process state","program counter","CPU registers","I/O status information"],"correct_answer":"program counter","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u4","target_id":135,"content":{"question":"Which of the following are process states?","options":["new","ready","running","waiting"],"correct_answer":"new\nready\nrunning\nwaiting","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u4","target_id":136,"content":{"question":"Which parts does a process contain?","options":["text section","program counter and registers","stack","heap"],"correct_answer":"text section\nprogram counter and registers\nstack\nheap","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u4","target_id":139,"content":{"question":"Which type of scheduler is responsible for selecting which processes to load into the ready queue?","options":["short-term scheduler","medium-term scheduler","dispatcher","long-term scheduler"],"correct_answer":"long-term scheduler","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u5","target_id":127,"content":{"question":"What is POSIX Pthreads?","options":["一個用於執行緒創建和同步的 API 標準","一個特定的執行緒實作","一個 Windows 專用的執行緒函式庫","一個只在 Java 虛擬機中使用的函式庫"],"correct_answer":"一個用於執行緒創建和同步的 API 標準","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":111,"content":{"question":"Little''s Formula (n = λ x W) 的特性是什麼？","options":["在穩態下，離開佇列的程序數等於到達的程序數","可以計算 CPU 使用率","適用於任何排程演算法","適用於任何到達分佈"],"correct_answer":"在穩態下，離開佇列的程序數等於到達的程序數\n適用於任何排程演算法\n適用於任何到達分佈","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":118,"content":{"question":"在 POSIX 即時排程中，SCHED_FIFO 的特點是什麼？","options":["沒有時間分片","提供時間分片","僅限於單核心系統","提供優先提升"],"correct_answer":"沒有時間分片","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":123,"content":{"question":"Linux在核心版本2.5中採用的O(1)排程器有哪些特性？","options":["搶佔式","基於優先權","有兩個優先權範圍:時程共享和即時","所有任務都放在一個佇列中"],"correct_answer":"搶佔式\n基於優先權\n有兩個優先權範圍:時程共享和即時","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":245,"content":{"question":"What are the characteristics of Windows scheduling?","options":["There is a queue for each priority level","It uses priority-based preemptive scheduling","It has a 32-level priority scheme","It can boost thread priorities"],"correct_answer":"There is a queue for each priority level\nIt uses priority-based preemptive scheduling\nIt has a 32-level priority scheme\nIt can boost thread priorities","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":249,"content":{"question":"How is aging implemented in Multilevel Feedback Queue scheduling?","options":["By reducing the number of queues for a process","By increasing the waiting time","By giving each process a fixed time quantum","By allowing a process to move between queues"],"correct_answer":"By allowing a process to move between queues","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":262,"content":{"question":"哪一個排程演算法被認為是最佳的，因為它能提供給定程序集的最小平均等待時間？","options":["短工作優先 (SJF)","先到先服務 (FCFS)","輪轉 (RR)","優先權排程"],"correct_answer":"短工作優先 (SJF)","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":270,"content":{"question":"In scheduling algorithm evaluation, what method uses a predetermined workload to define the performance of each algorithm?","options":["Implementation","Simulations","Deterministic modeling","Queueing models"],"correct_answer":"Deterministic modeling","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":285,"content":{"question":"What is the core objective of CPU scheduling?","options":["Minimize code complexity","Maximize I/O wait time","Decrease CPU utilization","Maximize CPU utilization"],"correct_answer":"Maximize CPU utilization","type":"choice"}},{"subject_id":"os","unit_id":"u6","target_id":289,"content":{"question":"What methods can be used to estimate the length of the next CPU burst?","options":["Setting α=1 to only consider the last burst","Asking the user","Using exponential averaging of previous CPU bursts","Using a constant value"],"correct_answer":"Setting α=1 to only consider the last burst\nAsking the user\nUsing exponential averaging of previous CPU bursts","type":"choice"}}]'::jsonb) as x(subject_id text,unit_id text,target_id bigint,content jsonb) on conflict(subject_id,unit_id,target_id) do update set content=excluded.content;
-- Every existing replacement base must still equal the catalog snapshot after this update.
do $$ begin if exists(select 1 from public.question_replacements r join public.builtin_question_targets t on (r.subject_id,r.unit_id,r.target_id)=(t.subject_id,t.unit_id,t.target_id) where r.target_kind='builtin' and r.base_content is distinct from t.content) then raise exception 'REPLACEMENT_BASE_CHANGED_RECHECK'; end if; end $$;
insert into public.collaboration_audit(actor_id,submission_id,action,before_data,after_data)
select (select user_id from public.collaboration_members where active and role='admin' order by user_id limit 1),e.submission_id,'reference_bank_sync',jsonb_build_object('published',to_jsonb(p),'submission',to_jsonb(s)),jsonb_build_object('published_id',e.id,'subject',e.subject_id,'unit',e.unit_id,'content',e.after,'source','https://yocheng06.github.io/course-library/','checked_on','2026-10-31') from bank_sync_shared e join public.published_questions p on p.id=e.id join public.question_submissions s on s.id=e.submission_id;
update public.published_questions p set content=e.after from bank_sync_shared e where p.id=e.id;
update public.question_submissions s set content=e.after,revision=revision+1,review_note=left(concat_ws(E'\n',nullif(review_note,''),'2026-10-31：已核對參考站，補齊原題與選項；保留原題號。'),2000),updated_at=now() from bank_sync_shared e where s.id=e.submission_id;
select (select count(*) from bank_sync_shared) as updated_shared,(select count(*) from public.builtin_question_targets) as registered_targets,(select count(*) from public.question_submissions) as submissions,(select count(*) from public.published_questions) as published;
commit;
